  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Reach Community College is an Australian provider of Nationally Recognised courses, specialising in Business, Building &amp; Civil Construction Design, Information Technology, Hospitality, Commercial Cookery, Community Services and Automotive courses. The College has two modern campuses located in Hobart and Sydney.</p><p>Established in 1901, it has a long history of giving students hands-on practical training, skills and knowledge to be job-ready in their chosen industry.</p><p>Reach Community College boasts a wide array of state-of-the-art facilities catering to its students' diverse needs. The campus has modern classrooms and lecture halls that provide an optimal learning environment equipped with advanced audiovisual technology to enhance the educational experience.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>At Reach Community College, students can find various accommodation options that cater to their needs and preferences. The College understands the importance of providing comfortable living spaces that foster a conducive learning environment. On-campus housing is available, offering students the convenience of being just steps away from their classes and campus facilities. These residence halls are well-maintained and offer a variety of room configurations to accommodate different preferences and budgets. Each room has essential amenities such as study areas, beds, storage spaces, and high-speed internet access.</p><p>Additionally, the College provides a supportive residential community that encourages student interaction and collaboration. Off-campus housing options are also available, with the College's housing office assisting students in finding suitable apartments or rental units nearby. Reach Community College strives to ensure students have a comfortable and enriching living experience at the institution.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Lab",
      "value": "<p>Additionally, Reach Community College takes pride in its well-equipped science laboratories, allowing students to engage in hands-on experiments and research.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Library",
      "value": "<p> The College's library is a knowledge hub, offering extensive print and digital resources, study spaces, and computer labs for research and academic support.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Sports",
      "value": "<p>The campus also features specialised facilities, such as a performing arts centre, sports complex, and fitness centre, catering to students' artistic, athletic, and wellness pursuits.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student Life",
      "value": "<p>The College promotes a sense of community and fosters opportunities for students to connect, collaborate, and thrive. Various student clubs, organisations, and extracurricular activities cater to multiple interests, allowing students to explore their passions, develop leadership skills, and forge lifelong friendships.</p><p>The College also hosts diverse events, including cultural celebrations, guest lectures, workshops, and performances, creating a dynamic and inclusive campus atmosphere. Students can actively participate in sports teams, intramural leagues, and recreational activities, promoting physical well-being and team spirit.</p>",
